WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.760
Hello everybody, my name is Markiplier

00:00:01.780 --> 00:00:03.460
and welcome back to Blank Dream

00:00:03.460 --> 00:00:05.260
It's finally back!

00:00:05.260 --> 00:00:07.080
It's finally here!

00:00:07.080 --> 00:00:08.660
After nearly a year of

00:00:08.660 --> 00:00:12.060
being missing in action, Blank Dream is gonna be finished

00:00:12.060 --> 00:00:12.840
in this episode. Now,

00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:16.020
I am very sorry that it took so long

00:00:16.020 --> 00:00:19.780
I have no other excuse besides my own laziness at this point.

00:00:19.780 --> 00:00:22.880
And, um, the reason it fell out initially was

00:00:22.880 --> 00:00:25.100
obviously because this, uh, the last episode

00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:27.960
came out just like a week or two before Daniel died

00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:29.160
and so that threw a wrench in everything

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:30.440
including all my plans

00:00:30.440 --> 00:00:33.340
Um, and also! I was using a different computer for a while there

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:36.080
So I didn't have the computer that had this save file on it

00:00:36.080 --> 00:00:39.140
and I just didn't have the motivation to go back and play through it all again

00:00:39.240 --> 00:00:42.820
BUT! This is the same save file that I had before

00:00:42.820 --> 00:00:45.260
It's the same game, we're picking it up

00:00:45.260 --> 00:00:47.460
I actually had to go back and re-watch

00:00:47.460 --> 00:00:49.300
the final episode of the game

00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:51.260
to know where we left off and what happened

00:00:51.260 --> 00:00:53.560
but Mishiro here  (silence) that's her name right?

00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:54.640
Is that not her name?

00:00:55.120 --> 00:00:55.700
Is that her?

00:00:55.940 --> 00:00:57.940
